<title>USA: Oil-Dri Corp stake held by Tweedy group.</title>
<headline>Oil-Dri Corp stake held by Tweedy group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Tweedy Browne Co L.P. said Wednesday it holds a 11.90 percent stake in Oil-Dri Corp of America or 533,438 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its latest transactions include the purchase of 224,800 common shares between April 27 and June 3 at prices ranging from $15.36811 to $15.375 per share.</p>
<p>Oil-Dri, based in Vernon Hills, Ill., makes and sells absorbent products for consumer, industrial, environmental, agricultural and fluid purification markets.</p>
</text>
